From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: flange <flange@local>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dts: tspi-rk3566: 启用 NPU（bus_npu / rknpu / rknpu_mmu）

tspi-rk3566-core-v10.dtsi 原先把 bus_npu、rknpu、rknpu_mmu 全部标为
disabled。NPU 供电为 RK809 DCDC4（vdd_npu），已由 bootloader patch
0001-uboot-dts-enable-vdd-npu 在 U-Boot 阶段打开并设 0.9V，内核 rknpu_mmu
probe 打开 NPU 电源域时不再 ack 超时（panic_on_set_idle）。这里改 core
dtsi，default / amp 系列 product 共用。
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/tspi-rk3566-core-v10.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/tspi-rk3566-core-v10.dtsi
index c9cd8f2b..08587938 100755
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/tspi-rk3566-core-v10.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/tspi-rk3566-core-v10.dtsi
@@ -284,7 +284,7 @@ &vp1 {
 &bus_npu {
 	bus-supply = <&vdd_logic>;
 	pvtm-supply = <&vdd_cpu>;
-	status = "disabled";
+	status = "okay";
 };
 
 //can0接口
@@ -760,12 +760,12 @@ &rkvenc_mmu {
 //神经网络处理
 &rknpu {
 	rknpu-supply = <&vdd_npu>;
-	status = "disabled";
+	status = "okay";
 };
 
 //神经网络内存管理
 &rknpu_mmu {
-	status = "disabled";
+	status = "okay";
 };
 
 //ADC
